The generated files in assets/onnxruntime/<version>/ are unmodified build
artifacts of ONNX Runtime's JavaScript packages, copied from the pinned
`onnxruntime-web` dev dependency by scripts/vendor-onnxruntime.mjs:

  - ort.node.min.mjs            (onnxruntime-web, dist/ort.node.min.mjs)
  - ort-wasm-simd-threaded.mjs  (onnxruntime-web, dist/ort-wasm-simd-threaded.mjs)
  - ort-wasm-simd-threaded.wasm (onnxruntime-web, dist/ort-wasm-simd-threaded.wasm)

The plugin also depends on `onnxruntime-common` from npm, which provides the
`onnxruntime-common` module the vendored entry imports. Both packages come from
the ONNX Runtime project: https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime

